    "format": "markdown",
    "text": "# Regional rainfall, first half of the year\n\nMonthly totals in millimetres, measured at three stations operated by the valley water board.\n\nRainfall by station\n\n| Month | Upper Ford | Millbrook | Estuary |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| January | 112 | 98 | 74 |\n| February | 87 | 90 | 61 |\n| March | 101 | 84 | 70 |\n| April | 64 | 59 | 42 |\n| May | 55 | 60 | 38 |\n| June | 47 | 41 | 29 |\n\n## Station metadata\n\n| Station | Elevation | Opened |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Upper Ford | 412 m | 1961 |\n| Millbrook | not recorded |  |\n| Estuary | 3 m | 1988 |\n\nTotals for Millbrook in March were estimated from a neighbouring gauge after a sensor fault."
